元素。以下是一些示例：\n“下一个场景：镜头从对飞船的特写中拉远，呈现出一个在奇幻景观中翱翔的整个舰队的广阔航拍视角。”\n“下一个场景：镜头向前追踪并向下倾斜，将太阳和直升机更紧密地纳入画面，同时强烈的镜头光晕增强。”\n“下一个场景：镜头向右平移，移除画面中的龙和骑手，同时揭示远处更多的漂浮山脉。”\n【输出格式】请严格遵循以下格式进行输出：\nNext Scene,[你对下一个镜头的中文描述]", "Huihui-Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct-abliterated", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 1997, "randomize", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 210, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 33, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", "label": "max_new_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_new_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "min_pixels"}, "name": "min_pixels", "label": "min_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "min_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_pixels"}, "name": "max_pixels", "label": "max_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention"}, "name": "attention", "label": "attention", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention"}], "flags": {}, "id": 20, "type": "Qwen3_VQA", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Qwen3_VQA"}, "order": 22}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MO